    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Setting Application (Configure webhooks)\n1. Go to n8n and add webhook node\n- node setting and allow multiple https\n- Change response to be **Using Response to Webhook node**\n2. From Get line add **Respond to Webhook** node\n- Change response to be **Text**\n- Use respnse body to be **{{ $json.query['hub.challenge'] }}**\n3. Setup call back on Facebook\n- Copy webhook from n8n webhook node and pass to Meassge API on facebook.\n- Verify token can be anything\n- Click **Execute workflow**\n- Then click **Verify and Save** on facebook\n- It will show some error but you sitll got the result\n4. Enable subscription on **Message** and **Message reads**(If it doesn't have Message option then refresh the page)",
        "height": 384,
