    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Setting Reply Message\n[Doc](https://developers.facebook.com/docs/messenger-platform/reference/send-api/)\n1. Add http request node\n2. Set \"Post\" method\n3. Use URL \"https://graph.facebook.com/v25.0/{Page_ID}/messages\"\n4. Set header Authen\n5. Set body request\n`{\n  \"recipient\": { \"id\": \"{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.entry[0].messaging[0].sender.id }}\" },\n  \"messaging_type\": \"RESPONSE\",\n  \"message\": { \"text\": \"hello, world\" }\n}`\n\nRemark:\n1. Authentication\n- Set authen\n-> Name = Authorization\n-> Token = Bearer {Token from Generat access token}\n2. Page Id\n- Check Page_ID from Token by [Page](https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/accesstoken/)",
        "height": 464,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 6
      },
